# Tokens of the in-process linter run the target builds from its input: the finding codes the policy compares with,
# the explanation prefix of a failed run, and the characters that stress a quoted explanation and a message.
"markdown/lfs-image-url"
"markdown/no-bare-urls"
"markdown/"
"lfs-image-url"
"core/processing-failure"
"monochromatic-lint: "
"(embedded configuration)"
"\\ud800"
"\x0a"
"..."
"\xe0"
"\xc0"
"\xd0"
